Create a Reel targeting the "Vibe Coding" trend. Use a hook like: "I audited 3 vibe-coded websites and fixed their security holes in 10 seconds using this free GitHub tool." Walk through a quick tutorial using the open-source tools mentioned by @nick_saraev. End with your signature high-conversion call to action: "Comment VIBE and I will DM you the step-by-step setup guide and GitHub repository."

